    q: "How much does undercounter dishwasher repair cost?",
    a: "$120 commercial diagnostic, applied toward repair. Most undercounter repairs run $440 to $760 all-in. Door gasket replacement, drain pump, wash pump impeller, booster heater, detergent dispenser. We quote on-site after diagnosis."
  },
  {
    q: "How fast can you respond to a bar undercounter emergency?",
    a: "Same-day across Los Angeles, Orange, Ventura in most cases. Phones answered 24/7. Bar service hours mean we often dispatch evenings, no emergency surcharge, $120 anytime. Friday and Saturday are our highest bar-service-call volume days."
  },
  {
    q: "What's your warranty?",
    a: "90 days SDAR labor warranty on every repair. BHGS #A49573, EPA 608 Universal certified (#1346255700410), BBB Accredited Business."
  }
];

